{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterDeletion","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterDeletion","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterReflectionCocycle"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterDeletion.exists_reduced_sublist'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterDeletion.exists_reduced_sublist'","kind":"theorem","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterDeletion.lean#L135-L138","doc":"The convenient form: no explicit length bookkeeping. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterDeletion.exists_reduced_sublist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterDeletion.exists_reduced_sublist","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterDeletion.lean#L111-L133","doc":"**Every word contains a reduced subword with the same product.**\n\nStronger than Mathlib's `exists_reduced_word'`, which produces *a* reduced word for the\nelement; here the reduced word is a `List.Sublist` of the word one started with. That is the\nform the Bruhat order's subword criterion consumes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterDeletion.exists_deletion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterDeletion.exists_deletion","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterDeletion.lean#L72-L109","doc":"**The deletion condition.** A word that is not reduced has two positions `a < b` whose\ndeletion leaves the product unchanged.\n\nThis is the classical companion of the exchange property, and it follows from the *strong*\nform proved in `CoxeterReflectionCocycle` with one induction along the word. ","signatureChunk":0}]}